            "review_title": "Review at Vuvuzela Beer Club",
            "review_text": "SimonL\nAuckland, New Zealand4 contributions\n0\nVuvu no zela\nJul 2019 • Friends\nWe went to the bar this afternoon for a birthday lunch in a group of 11.\nFirst impressions were of a tidy clean space with many quite small TV's which made us cross it off the sports bar list.\nWe were offered no less than 4 menus covering drinks and food, but they need not have bothered since fully half the food on the menus was not available. What we did order was done through pointing at pictures since no English was in evidence ( not unusual in Hanoi) but they still managed to bring the wrong dishes.\nWith the World Cup Cricket, the British Grand Prix and Wimbledon all on today you would have thought as a craft beer pub the beer would ready to go. But no. Half the craft beer was unavailable and the bottled beer was warm! Total waste of time.\nRead more\nWritten July 14, 2019",
